```java
String s = "algorithm";
int cuts = 0;
while (s.length() > 0 && s.charAt(s.length() - 1) != 'l') {
    s = s.substring(0, s.length() - 1);
    cuts++;
}
System.out.println(s + " " + cuts);
```

